error[T-Bound]: `T` requires `Shareable`, and `Counter` is not `Shareable`: it holds a `counter.Handle`, which names an object C holds
  --> tests/ffi/a_c_object_does_not_meet_the_shareable_bound/main.lin:15:18
   |
15 |     let status = read_from_any_task(tally)
   |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `Counter` is not `Shareable`; keep it in one task or in an owning task, or, if the C library guarantees concurrent access is safe for every operation its wrapper exposes through shared reads, mark `counter.Handle` `@shareable` in that trusted wrapper, or drop the bound
